---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { loadDirectory } from '../lib/load.mjs';
const { site, buildDate } = loadDirectory();
---
<Base title={`Privacy policy | ${site.brand}`} description={`How ${site.brand} handles information.`} path="/privacy/" noindex={true}>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
  </Fragment>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>Last updated {buildDate}.</p>
    <p>{site.brand} lists businesses using publicly available business information (name, address, phone, website, hours, ratings). We do not publish personal information about private individuals. Business owners may request corrections or removal through the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
    <p>When you claim a listing, we store your name, role, email and the profile details you submit in a database in the European Union, and we send you a confirmation link by email through our email delivery provider. After you confirm, a cookie keeps you signed in to your profile for 30 days; it is needed for the claim to work and is used for nothing else. We use your email to run your listing, and for news and offers only if you tick that box. Details you submit are shown on your listing once we approve it. Your session price is shown only if you choose to show it; either way it is used in anonymous comparisons where at least five practitioners are grouped together. Ask us at any time to correct or delete your details.</p>
    <p>When you submit the contact form, the details you enter are sent to us by email so we can respond. We do not sell or share them. This site does not use advertising trackers.</p>
    <p>When you ask for the device comparison on the ROI calculator, we receive your email, country, budget, buying timeline, background and the numbers you entered, so we can send you the comparison. We pass your details to authorised device distributors only if you tick the box that allows it.</p>
    <p>We measure how the site is used with Matomo, an analytics tool we host ourselves on a server in the European Union. It records the pages you view, the clicks on a listing's phone, website, directions and claim links, and what you search for. It does not set cookies, it shortens your IP address before storing it, and the data is not shared with anyone. Practitioners who claim their listing can see the totals for their own listing.</p>
    <p>Region pages show a map. Its map images are loaded from OpenStreetMap when the map scrolls into view, so your browser connects to their servers then; we send them no information about you.</p>
    <p>Hosting and form delivery are provided by third parties who process data on our behalf. Questions: <a href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>{site.contact.email}</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
